1. **`packages/ai/src/providers/openai-responses.ts`** - Add strict pairing logic in `convertMessages()` as default behavior
2. **`packages/ai/CHANGELOG.md`** - Document the fix

The same logic would need to be in `azure-openai-responses.ts` once PR #890 is merged (or the shared module is created as badlogic requested).
